sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Respondent
    participant P as Survey page
    participant A as Hono API
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant PG as Local PostgreSQL (dev only)

    opt File question
        P->>A: POST /api/files (multipart file)
        A->>A: re-check type and size (max 700 KB)
        A->>FS: files/{fileId} = name, type, base64
        A-->>P: 201 { id }
    end

    U->>P: Submit answers
    P->>P: zodResolver validates (client)
    P->>A: POST /api/forms/:id/submissions
    A->>FS: load form + questions
    A->>A: buildAnswerSchema(questions) validates body
    alt Invalid
        A-->>P: 400 invalid_answers + issues
    else Unknown file id
        A->>FS: file exists?
        A-->>P: 400 Unknown file
    else Valid
        A->>FS: transaction: set submission, responseCount +1 only if new
        FS-->>A: saved
        opt NODE_ENV is not production and DATABASE_URL is set
            A->>PG: copy submission + answers (same ids)
            Note over A,PG: a Postgres failure is logged, not returned
        end
        A-->>P: 201 { id }
    end

    participant R as readWithFallback
    participant O as Developer

    P->>A: GET /api/forms/:id
    A->>R: getForm(id)
    R->>FS: primary read
    alt Firestore answers (a form or null)
        FS-->>R: form or null
        R-->>A: result (null becomes 404)
    else Firestore throws and local Postgres is enabled
        FS--xR: error (logged)
        R->>PG: fallback read
        PG-->>R: form or null
        R-->>A: result
    else Firestore throws in production
        FS--xR: error
        R-->>A: error (500)
    end
    A-->>P: 200 form, or 404

    Note over O,PG: Refresh the local copy (local only)
    O->>A: GET /api/sync/status (Bearer token)
    A->>FS: form ids and submission counts
    A->>PG: form ids and submission count
    A-->>O: missingInPostgres, onlyInPostgres, inSync
    O->>A: POST /api/sync (Bearer token)
    A->>FS: read all forms and submissions
    A->>PG: upsert forms, questions and submissions
    A->>PG: delete forms that no longer exist in Firestore
    A-->>O: forms, submissions, removed
